{"version":1,"content":"<p>今晨（12日）8時許，警方接獲慈雲山慈正邨保安員報案，發現一名男童懷疑從高處墮下，倒臥在正旭樓對開地下。</p><p>救護員到場，證實年約13歲男事主當場身亡。</p><p>警方正調查事故原因。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T04:38:21.735810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T04:03:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T11:57:38.878456+00:00","content_updated_at":null,"content_hash":"21472df21b2b091a72b59d0edaac9d3e852be9dd446cea8fae86502db9b353fd","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}